  {
    "id": "51cb5ee7-f46e-4006-9713-cb81078d6ddd",
    "label": "Careful Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you cast a spell that forces other creatures to make a saving throw, you can protect some of those creatures from the spell's full force. To do so, you spend 1 sorcery point and choose a number of those creatures up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one creature). A chosen creature automatically succeeds on its saving throw against the spell.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "2dae3363-af10-4390-9a00-7c4c88899967",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 1
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": "7aa9155e-eb0f-4fe5-a4cb-b5b1c9dd6c3a",
    "label": "Distant Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you cast a spell that has a range of 5 feet or greater, you can spend 1 sorcery point to double the range of the spell.</p><p>When you cast a spell that has a range of touch, you can spend 1 sorcery point to make the range of the spell 30 feet.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "55e6240e-4659-4501-9f34-e48d4f5cf02b",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 1
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": "ce095390-6222-4c31-8000-a534271f65ba",
    "label": "Empowered Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you roll damage for a spell, you can spend 1 sorcery point to reroll a number of the damage dice up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one). You must use the new rolls.</p><p>You can use Empowered Spell even if you have already used a different Metamagic option during the casting of the spell.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "e6501e35-b1fc-44a6-a6a3-8cb237330281",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 1
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": "1272ce56-97f0-4a50-b035-decbe3e11d0f",
    "label": "Extended Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you cast a spell that has a duration of 1 minute or longer, you can spend 1 sorcery point to double its duration, to a maximum duration of 24 hours.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "7a5e2008-8116-4c5d-91b2-d244da474954",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 1
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": "af9539aa-113c-4e32-99be-aebddc09eead",
    "label": "Heightened Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you cast a spell that forces a creature to make a saving throw to resist its effects, you can spend 3 sorcery points to give one target of the spell disadvantage on its first saving throw made against the spell.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "8afc9b63-b966-40a9-8919-e26b1c66395c",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 3
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": "77760d7a-c82c-4fff-965c-3ce45617b06e",
    "label": "Quickened Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you cast a spell that has a casting time of 1 action, you can spend 2 sorcery points to change the casting time to 1 bonus action for this casting.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "b13ef1d2-a44e-4b67-bda9-f2b63c80cb2c",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 2
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": "a074b362-fea6-4898-9d4d-e87b7024f549",
    "label": "Subtle Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you cast a spell, you can spend 1 sorcery point to cast it without any somatic or verbal components.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "b110c063-28c3-415b-ad2e-cff4b4b357db",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 1
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": "75d786ea-c408-4ad5-8324-f815a7cae143",
    "label": "Twinned Spell",
    "description": "<p>When you cast a spell that targets only one creature and doesn't have a range of self, you can spend a number of sorcery points equal to the spell's level to target a second creature in range with the same spell (1 sorcery point if the spell is a cantrip).</p><p>To be eligible, a spell must be incapable of targeting more than one creature at the spell's current level. For example, <em>magic missile</em>&nbsp;and <em>scorching ray</em> aren't eligible, but <em>ray of frost</em> and <em>chromatic orb</em> are.</p>",
    "charges": {
      "id": "a8051eeb-af64-416f-a391-f6cf8fddd649",
      "limitId": "c6b4ecb8-9246-4235-8e8a-4648d63a7ebe",
      "currentPoints": 1
    },
    "levelAvailable": "3"
  },
